      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انطمّ</span></b> , said of a rivulet, [and in like manner
of a well, &amp;c.,] <i>It became filled up</i> with earth, or
dust, <i>so as to be even with the ground</i> [<i>around it</i>].
(Mgh.)

